<Root>
  <DefaultMacro>
    <Major>BlackMamba0205</Major>
    <Description>This is a macro by BlackMamba0205
Use these setting for the best aim, fov 90 sensitivity 0.4 dpi 800

This is for the Rust Nailgun ONLY and easy to use, you just have to bind the script to a key then you are beaming everyone. Simple script, auto spams the Nailgun if you are too lazy or just have bad aim

99% accuracy crouch

98% accuracy standing

The best for Your NAILGUN

</Description>
    <Comment></Comment>
    <GUIOption>
      <RepeatType>1</RepeatType>
    </GUIOption>
    <KeyUp>
      <Syntax></Syntax>
    </KeyUp>
    <KeyDown>
      <Syntax>Delay 10 ms
LeftDown 1
Delay 10 ms
MoveR 0 14
Delay 10 ms
MoveR 0 14
Delay 10 ms
MoveR 0 14
Delay 10 ms
LeftUp 1
Delay 10 ms</Syntax>
    </KeyDown>
    <Software>Rust</Software>
  </DefaultMacro>
</Root>